{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"STATUS: PLAN CERTIFIED AND TICKET CLAIMED — READY TO IMPLEMENT. No code written yet.\n\nCertified at 6cdd4b00d9 and claimed (in_progress). Reparented under epic e369-a449-4773-48fb by\noperator ruling: all three defects that J11's new cells surfaced gate that epic's closure.\n\n**SERIALIZATION CONSTRAINT — READ BEFORE STARTING.** This ticket and 88d9-fe42-e50f-4067 BOTH modify\n`inbound_differ.py`. Do NOT run them in parallel. Land this one first, then 88d9 (88d9 additionally\ntouches `fetcher.py`, so once this is merged the two no longer overlap in review).\n\nFILE IMPACT is declared: `inbound_differ.py` plus a new\n`tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_link_removal_2b16.py`.\n\nTHE DEFECT: `_diff_links_inbound` is ADD-ONLY BY CONSTRUCTION (`inbound_differ.py:380,396`) — a link\nremoved in Jira is never mirrored locally, while the OUTBOUND direction does have a removal path. So\nthe two directions are asymmetric and the inbound half silently drops information.\n\nA LIVE ORACLE ALREADY EXISTS AND IS EXPECTED RED:\n`tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_dc_mutations.py::test_inbound_delete_link_round_trips`. It asserts\nthe counterpart key is ABSENT from the read-back link set after the add was proven to land. It is red\nbecause the product is broken, not because the test is wrong. **DO NOT edit or invert it** — another\nticket owns that file, and this fix should turn it green.\n\nWHEN IMPLEMENTING: assert ABSENCE positively (the dep is gone), never \"no exception raised\" — every\ndefect in this family has been a silent success. Mutation-check the fix and confirm the RED message\nnames the missing removal rather than an AttributeError."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785725136358713001,"uuid":"7f713124-ca96-4624-abe2-687e27b804b6"}